OL,3,GNEWSAArtist 'taking legal advice' over
OL,4,ATories' use of Andy Burnham portrait
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artist has said he is taking legal
OL,7,Fadvice after accusing the Conservative
OL,8,FParty of copying his portrait of Andy
OL,9,FBurnham at their party conference.
OL,11,FPeople attending the party's conference
OL,12,Fin Birmingham have been handed water
OL,13,Fbottles featuring the image and
OL,14,Flabelled "Bottler Burnham" and "0%
OL,15,Fstrength" and sweets labelled "Andy
OL,16,FPanders' People Pleaser Pick N Mix".
OL,18,FLabour supporter Stanley Chow, who
OL,19,Fcreated the image for Burnham's 2021
OL,20,Fmayoral campaign in Greater Manchester,
OL,21,Fhas claimed the party did not ask for
OL,22,Fpermission to use the image.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
